@startuml
actor User
participant Controller
participant OrderService
participant OrderMapper
participant BaseFunction

User -> Controller: 发起订单列表查看请求
activate Controller
Controller -> OrderService: 调用orderPage方法
activate OrderService
OrderService -> OrderMapper: 调用orderPage方法查询订单列表
activate OrderMapper
OrderMapper --> OrderService: 返回订单列表查询结果
deactivate OrderMapper
OrderService -> BaseFunction: 调用stringToList方法处理餐品图片
activate BaseFunction
BaseFunction --> OrderService: 返回处理后的餐品图片列表
deactivate BaseFunction
loop 对每个订单进行处理
    OrderService -> OrderService: 遍历订单列表，处理餐品图片
end
OrderService --> Controller: 返回订单列表查询结果
deactivate OrderService
Controller --> User: 返回订单列表查询结果
deactivate Controller
@enduml
